{"name": "The Hundredth Floor: Extraction", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"161\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/d455375d84a78994c2da7495150762d5.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>The Hundredth Floor: Extraction</i>, you are a QA tester trapped inside a virtual world by a critical system bug. To find your way back to reality, you must gear up, grow stronger, and conquer every floor of the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/2a105a430e2299ac537ae720e10a3208.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"800\"/></span>As a senior game tester caught in a bizarre accident, a fatal bug has disabled the logout button and sent this virtual world into complete chaos. Want to return to reality? Grab your weapons and hack your way through a collapsing, mutant-infested 100-floor abyss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/5c03eb432c459601be179b1a76c73fa5.poster.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/5c03eb432c459601be179b1a76c73fa5.webm?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/5c03eb432c459601be179b1a76c73fa5.mp4?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"218\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/6d91942834af6c252d9c7f3c61c8a416.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"800\"/></span>The core gameplay blends satisfying ARPG looter-slasher combat with nerve-wracking extraction mechanics. Explore 100 procedurally generated, biome-diverse dungeons. Will you extract with a backpack full of epic gear, or gamble your life for legendary drops deeper down? Remember: if you die, your hard-earned loot is deleted with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/b851f18c657b6b5d6bc9554638a3a121.poster.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/b851f18c657b6b5d6bc9554638a3a121.webm?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/b851f18c657b6b5d6bc9554638a3a121.mp4?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"209\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/6a61d82869ddcebba9b1b9b67f1ae423.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"800\"/></span>Break the game with a massive, unrestricted talent tree, dozens of base weapons, and over 1,000 random gear affixes. Whether it's explosive melee strikes, a bullet-hell barrage, or summoning a tide of magic, your wildest ideas can be transformed into unstoppable combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/d4470ccbbc336bcb41aed77b241533c0.poster.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/d4470ccbbc336bcb41aed77b241533c0.webm?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/d4470ccbbc336bcb41aed77b241533c0.mp4?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"208\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/53bb355555c24e347162601ae0b97ee9.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"800\"/></span>Combine hundreds of spells and skills, triggering explosive chain reactions using elemental status effects like Ignite, Freeze, and Paralyze. Face off against complex abyss bosses with unique mechanics. Master dodges and skill combos to enjoy the perfect mix of satisfying hack-and-slash action and hardcore strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/cb015bf1679c40095e5fcb1ee1e0b775.poster.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/cb015bf1679c40095e5fcb1ee1e0b775.webm?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/cb015bf1679c40095e5fcb1ee1e0b775.mp4?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"211\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/b7c9cbcbbec06d8dff270b146169b505.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"800\"/></span>On your journey to escape, you will encounter various NPCs stranded in the glitched code. Complete their quests, collect scattered clues, and unravel the shocking conspiracy behind the world's collapse. The truth is often more despairing than the abyss itself...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/88bddc2e03255369aad61293cfb8900c.poster.avif?t=1786582832\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/88bddc2e03255369aad61293cfb8900c.webm?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/extras/88bddc2e03255369aad61293cfb8900c.mp4?t=1786582832\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A 3D single-player ARPG blending looter-slasher & extraction mechanics. Delve into a 100-floor abyss where you must choose: play it safe or risk it all! Craft unique builds with massive talent trees & 1,000+ affixes. Defeat bosses and extract with epic loot, or lose everything to greed!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172090/abcd81fe10115d7b63fb911d60b7fe238fb713d6/header.jpg?t=1786582832", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Dungeon Crawler", "RPG", "Loot", "Extraction Shooter", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "JohnHang", "publishers": "JohnHang", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4172090", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "13 February 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_Aid5ygdtr8", "first_seen": 1770937200.0, "review_rank": 1223}